       <widget class="QLabel" name="label">
        <property name="text">
         <string>Visual Snap is a way to snap to specific points in a drawing by interpreting the natural geometry of existing elements (lines, points, intersections, and circles), reducing the need for manual calculations and the construction of auxiliary geometry.
Appearance and sizes of Visual Snap elements is customized below.</string>
