      <item row="17" column="0" colspan="2">
       <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbVisualSnapShowNotSnappableGuides">
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>Show Far Not Snappable

If selected, guiding entites that are far from the mouse cursor point and
are not within snap range and therefore will not be snapped 
will be also shown. 
That may provide better overview for all possible snap points,
yet in some cases may visualy overcrowd the snap by guiding entities.
Otherwise, only guiding entities that are within snap range
and thus may be snapped will be visible.</string>
        </property>
        <property name="text">
         <string>Show far not snappable guiding entities </string>
        </property>
       </widget>
